+# Corpus fetching
+
+The corpus fetch respected Svipall's per-domain limit of **12 visits per
+60-second window**. After a breach, the domain entered a **900-second (15-minute)
+cooldown**.
+
+Files were fetched through these origin/CDN mirror hosts:
+
+- `raw.githubusercontent.com`
+- `cdn.jsdelivr.net`, using paths of the form
+  `cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/owner/repo@branch/path`
+- `cdn.statically.io`
+
+`cdn.statically.io` was used, but was slow and sometimes timed out during the
+fetch.
